  "summary_en": "Annexes 1–9 to the European Commission's April 2021 proposal for the EU Artificial Intelligence Act. They define AI techniques, list Union harmonisation legislation (machinery, medical devices, vehicles, drones), enumerate high-risk AI use cases, and set technical documentation, declaration of conformity and conformity assessment requirements.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Annex I defines AI techniques: machine learning, logic- and knowledge-based, and statistical approaches.",
   "Annex II lists Union harmonisation legislation covering machinery, medical devices, vehicles and unmanned aircraft.",
   "Annex III lists high-risk AI areas such as biometrics, critical infrastructure, employment, law enforcement and migration.",
   "Annex IV sets technical documentation content including risk management, human oversight and testing.",
   "Annexes V–VII set the EU declaration of conformity and conformity assessment procedures."
